<< /A 42 0 R /Alt (Bar chart comparing short-form disagreement rates by pattern category: fast-inconsistent at 20.7 percent, slow or interrupted at 17.2 percent, stable-typical at 13.9 percent, and mixed pattern at 13.1 percent.) /K 1 /P 8 0 R /Pg 31 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
